PROPRIETARY SOFTWARE — PUBLICLY VIEWABLE FOR TECHNICAL REASONS
================================================================

This repository hosts the IAR Archive project (Iraqi Administrative
Reference Repository). It is made publicly available for two reasons:

  1. To serve as a CDN for the reference documents via GitHub Raw,
     which is a technical requirement of the deployed website.

  2. To allow public viewing of the reference documents contained
     within it.

Public availability of this repository does NOT constitute an
open-source license, nor does it grant permission to use, modify,
or distribute the source code or any other project material,
except as explicitly stated below.


